    "bg": "living-blood",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期五 · 14:32",
    "audio": "quiet",
    "tv": "still",
    "closeTV": false,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "他从那人袖口里抽出一团布，放到手边。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-blood",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期五 · 14:32",
    "audio": "quiet",
    "tv": "still",
    "closeTV": false,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "那人的袖子被拉到了肩膀。舅公抓着衣领，接着往外拽。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-blood",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期五 · 14:32",
    "audio": "quiet",
    "tv": "still",
    "closeTV": false,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "外套掉到地上。他捡起来搭在椅背上，用脚把鞋拨开。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-blood",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期五 · 14:32",
    "audio": "quiet",
    "tv": "still",
    "closeTV": false,
    "speaker": "",
    "text": "我从杯子里喝了一口水。已经不热了。"
  },
  {
    "bg": "living-blood",
    "location": "一楼 · 客厅",
    "clock": "星期五 · 14:32",
    "audio": "quiet",
    "tv": "still",
    "closeTV": false,
    "speaker": "我",
    "text": "我先回去了。"
